2685:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_ReceiverTimeout_Config() API allows to configure the receiver timeout value on th
2686:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_EnableReceiverTimeout() API enables the receiver timeout feature
2687:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_DisableReceiverTimeout() API disables the receiver timeout feature
